  "feature_engineering": {
    "point_in_time": "Each feature uses only data before prediction moment: TLS version/cipher/KEX/ja4_rarity from ClientHello/ServerHello, cert fields from ServerCertificate, STARTTLS mode from EHLO, pre_tls_buffer_len from reassembler 220->ClientHello window \u2014 no post-event label data.",
    "leakage_check": "Label = rules.py 23 checks + score.py risk_level \u2192 direct leakage: FEATURES_TOP5 are exact inputs to those checks; TOP5 removal (B) tests rule-proxy survival; JA4 rarity single-feature AUC 0.926 is dataset artifact proxy not security discovery; port is deployment proxy; behavioral-7 tests true STARTTLS Bennett signal.",
    "encoding": "Categorical native XGB enable_categorical True (version,cipher_strength,kex,starttls_mode,port,cert_missing_reason) \u2014 no ordinal impose; numeric scaled via normalize_value; miss indicators preserve missingness as own category per feature-engineering.",
    "train_serve_skew": "Shared build_vector() in assessment/features.py used both train and serve; no reimplementation \u2014 single definition guarantees equivalence."
